# Per-service Yggdrasil port forwarders

Each `.forward` file defines one socat TCP6→TCP4 forwarder.
Format: shell variables sourced by the entrypoint script.

  PORT=<port-to-listen-on-over-yggdrasil>
  TARGET=<container-name>:<port>

Example (Jellyfin):
  PORT=8096
  TARGET=jellyfin:8096

Managed by: homelab ygg enable/disable
